domain SemanticProbeV2Result:
  description "Audit the exact consumed v2 run, without correction or resubmission."
evidence E1:
  "E-PROBEV2-101: live-result records6network requests,18transport events,6durable requests,13work events, statusreview_required, activatedfalse,currentGenerationUnchangedtrue. All6HTTP statuses200 and6receipt outcomes succeeded. Source/runtime proof451cc1c5 was verified by the launcher. Total usage162840input+2895output=165735tokens; non-discounted tariff estimateUSD0.2107875; aggregate request elapsed28451ms. Billing invoice is not observed."
evidence E2:
  "E-PROBEV2-102: calls1,3,5 each start with retire_to_capsule definition.actionNorms and later write/defer the same path. Call5 includes one basic-action executable selector in synthesize, but final draft actionNorms remains empty. Every repair input includes overlapping_operations. Merge source applies retirement by clearing the current slot, records it in written, then rejects overlapping later operations in the same response."
evidence E3:
  "E-PROBEV2-103: calls2and6 review results include unregistered disclosurePolicy and compilerCompatibility target/dependant paths. applyReviewResponse uses any-invalid-path over the entire finding array and returns reviewnull plus generic review_path_invalid. Call3repair contains this generic error, not the valid sibling missing-selector/fallback explanations. Call4review has registered paths and its findings are passed to call5repair."
evidence E4:
  "E-PROBEV2-104: final candidate parses structurally but actionNorms and mechanicalConflictFallbacks are empty. Two guidance statements, priorities60/40 and always applicability remain. Fallback is deferred; compatibilityblocked. Preservation entries contain byte-equivalent old actionNorms values. Runtime was not activated. Code separates structural validation, compatibility and semantic review."
evidence E5:
  "E-PROBEV2-105: reviewer alleges old actionNorm statement disclosure rules remain, but actual candidate in all three review requests has zero such rules. Call4alleges generic always conditions lost original meaning, while source and candidate conditions are identical always clauses. These particular review assertions are contradicted by payload; other findings and access effects need separate assessment. Do not accept every model finding as truth."
premise U1:
  "Why the generator repeatedly ignored overlap feedback and chose deferral is not established from model internals. Prompt ambiguity, operation-vocabulary design, context salience and model behavior remain competing deeper explanations. This run cannot rank them. No unsupported claim that a missed test is the defect-producing root cause. Same-model review does not establish independent semantic truth."
decision C1 based_on E1, E4:
  "C-PROBEV2-101 high confidence: the prior initial schema rejection is absent in this run; both change-set and review grammars were accepted. Overall migration is unsuccessful/review_required, not ready for owner acceptance or production. Natural repair was observed twice but did not converge."
decision C2 based_on E2, U1:
  "C-PROBEV2-102 high confidence observed failure mechanism: generated change sets repeatedly combine destructive retirement and replacement/deferral of the same path. The merger's clear-then-overlap-reject semantics prevent the call5selector from reaching the candidate. This is a producer/integration contract mismatch in the observed sequence; the deeper reason for repeated model choices remains unknown. Source preservation is distinct from usable migrated values."
decision C3 based_on E3, E5:
  "C-PROBEV2-103 high confidence contributing implementation mechanism: review path validation is all-or-nothing, so an invalid finding suppresses valid sibling explanations and reduces useful first-repair feedback. The final reviewnull is explained by this mechanism, not by absent HTTP response. A complete root-cause correction is not established or implemented. Reviewer false positives are separate from real empty selector/fallback state."
decision A1 based_on C1, C2, C3, E1, E4, U1:
  "A-PROBEV2-003 verification-only: preserve the consumed run, all request/response/receipt evidence, exact source and final draft. Write Japanese result with API improvement versus failed end-to-end migration, confirmed mechanisms, deeper unknowns and actual-usage-based estimated cost. Seal acceptance and all results; update continuation after impact. Do not modify code, retry, add calls, activate, executeB6, commit,push or stop the shared workday. Further corrective design and causal discrimination require a separate task decision, not silently changing this experiment."
